<newsitem itemid="351013" id="root" date="1997-02-03" xml:lang="en">
<title>VENEZUELA: Venezuela Sudamtex H1 share up.</title>
<headline>Venezuela Sudamtex H1 share up.</headline>
<dateline>CARACAS 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Net profit per share 5.28 bolivars vs 4.30 bolivars</p>
<p>Sales 33.7 bln bolivars vs 38.7</p>
<p>Cost of sales 27.2 bln bolivars vs 30.9 bln bolivars</p>
<p>Administrative costs 3.8 bln bolivars vs 3.6 bln bolivars</p>
<p>Financing gain 4.9 bln bolivars vs 1.9 bln bolivars</p>
<p>Net profit 6.3 bln bolivars vs 5.1 bln bolivars</p>
<p>Notes: Period ends December 31</p>
<p>Results are consolidated and expressed in constant December 31 1996 bolivars.</p>
<p>Sudamtex de Venezuela CA is a textile company.</p>
<p>((-- Caracas newsroom, 582 505 2600))</p>
</text>
